{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-05-27 13:58:00', 'title': "HIGH-PERFORMING STUDENTS EARN PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER'S 2021 “STREAM OF LEARNING” SCHOLARSHIPS", 'text': "MECHANICSBURG, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 10 STUDENTS WERE SELECTED TO RECEIVE $1,000 SCHOLARSHIPS THROUGH THE COMPANY'S SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM."}